# Repository-only content, not part of the installed plugin.
#
# docs/ is the source of the published manual and landing page; .github/ holds
# the CI workflows. No shipped code path opens either -- every Help link in the
# plugin resolves to the online manual -- yet together they were most of the
# archive. Same convention as zero2cartolab and qgis_25d_styling.
docs
.github
# Repository-only content, not part of the installed plugin.
# Every Help link in the plugin resolves to the online manual; no shipped code
# path opens a local copy. Same convention as planx_geostats.
SUITABILITY_REFERENCE_MANUAL.html

# QGIS writes its default local style library into the working directory when a
# headless run starts there. It is ~1 MB of runtime artifact, not plugin code.
symbology-style.db
